# Clan Aundae: "Vampire's Child" (VA_VampChild). Dhaunayne Aundae greets the new Aundae vampire (PcVampire and
# VampClan 1), takes the player's service ("plan to serve me": 10) and tells of her son ("about my family": 20,
# "I will find out about your child." 1: 30 and her family ring). In Sadrith Mora's Mages Guild Iniel knows the
# crest (50) and Tusamircil sends the player on with Sinyaramen's potion (60, "I'll take it to him." 1: 66).
# Sinyaramen in the Gateway Inn takes it (70) and tells of his grandfather Vilandon (90; the 80 aside, "killed by
# your kind", is a topic nothing has named yet). Dhaunayne orders Kjeld's death (100);
# killed in Druscashti, she is satisfied (120).
# The kill stands in for the fight; `approach` stands in for the travel.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from va_child_start --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case va_child_start
approach 05A7D05F
talk dhaunayne aundae
ask plan to serve me
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampChild == 10
ask about my family
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampChild == 20
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampChild == 30
expect player->GetItemCount "extravagant_ring_aund_uni" == 1
bye
end

case va_child_crest
approach 05ACC1C0
talk iniel
ask family crest
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampChild == 50
bye
approach 0575D6E5
talk tusamircil
ask family crest
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampChild == 60
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampChild == 66
expect player->GetItemCount "p_sinyaramen_unique" == 1
bye
end

case va_child_sinyaramen
approach 05BC95F9
talk sinyaramen
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampChild == 70
ask Vilandon
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampChild == 90
end

case va_child_kjeld
approach 05A7D05F
talk dhaunayne aundae
ask about my family
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampChild == 100
bye
approach 05741E1B
defend
console 05741E1B.kill
until 600 "kjeld"->GetHealth <= 0
approach 05A7D05F
talk dhaunayne aundae
ask Kjeld
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampChild == 120
bye
end
